# Documents ship with the site — the depository links straight at them.
# Only the ones still waiting to be compressed are listed here. Delete a
# line the moment its file is small enough and the depository picks it up.
# Committing a large PDF now and replacing it later leaves BOTH copies in
# git history forever, so it is worth compressing first.
#
# Sizes as of 4 September 2026, largest first:
#   annual-report-2021 ................. 67.7 MB
#   annual-report-2022 ................. 24.4 MB
#   eu-wbf-joint-action-2024-2025 ...... 16.7 MB
#   annual-report-2024-2025 ............ 14.6 MB
#   eu-wbf-joint-action-second-call .... 9.8 MB
#
# Everything else in assets/documents/ is published. For reference, the
# largest file already shipping is annual-report-2020 at 5.0 MB.
